{
 "title": "作为表达式的 if",
 "blocks": [
  {
   "t": "p",
   "text": "`if` 也可以产生一个值：`if 条件 then A else B`。结果可以直接赋给变量。`else` 是必须的，所有分支必须是**相同**的类型。"
  },
  {
   "t": "code",
   "code": [
    "fn main():",
    "    age = 20",
    "    status = if age >= 18 then \"Adult\" else \"Child\"",
    "    print(status)",
    "",
    "    score = 75",
    "    grade = if score >= 90 then \"A\" elif score >= 70 then \"B\" else \"C\"",
    "    print(\"Grade:\", grade)"
   ],
   "run": true,
   "output": [
    "Adult",
    "Grade: B"
   ]
  },
  {
   "t": "exercise",
   "id": "c02-l02-x1",
   "prompt": "用 `if ... then ... else` 写变量 `sign`：`n` 为负时是 `-1`，否则是 `1`。然后输出它。",
   "starter": [
    "fn main():",
    "    n = -7",
    "    sign = 0",
    "    print(sign)"
   ],
   "solution": [
    "fn main():",
    "    n = -7",
    "    sign = if n < 0 then -1 else 1",
    "    print(sign)"
   ],
   "hint": "`sign = if n < 0 then -1 else 1`",
   "expected": [
    "-1"
   ]
  },
  {
   "t": "quiz",
   "id": "c02-l02-q1",
   "q": "`if` 表达式中必须写 `else` 吗？",
   "options": [
    "不必",
    "必须",
    "只有存在 `elif` 时"
   ],
   "answer": 1,
   "why": "产生值的 `if` 必须在每种情况下都给出一个值。"
  }
 ]
}
